    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Boba&apos;s lightweight per-eye viewer overlays. Each command retains the producer&apos;s 14-float layout and is interpreted in source-image pixels. Keeping these commands out of the video bitstream lets the Quest render controller rays and placement markers at the OpenXR swapchain resolution. </para>
